@page
@model RROMS.Web.Pages.Dev.StyleGuideModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Design system";
}

<header class="rr-page-header">
    <div>
        <span class="rr-label">Development only</span>
        <h1>RROMS design system</h1>
        <p class="rr-lede">
            The look of a kopitiam: marble tabletops, white enamel, painted shop signs, and the docket that goes
            to the kitchen. Build every page from these pieces. DESIGN.md in the repo has the rules and the markup.
        </p>
    </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav nav-pills mb-5" aria-label="On this page">
    <a class="nav-link" href="#principles">Principles</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#colour">Colour</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#type">Type</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#words">Words</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#buttons">Buttons</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#status">Status</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#forms">Forms</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#dockets">Dockets</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#board">Order rail</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#bookings">Bookings</a>
    <a class="nav-link" href="#pieces">Page pieces</a>
</nav>

<section class="sg-section" id="principles">
    <h2>Principles</h2>
    <ul class="sg-principles">
        <li><strong>One action colour.</strong> Pandan green is for things people can do: buttons, links, the option they chose. Status colours describe a state and are never pressed.</li>
        <li><strong>Records are dockets.</strong> Anything that changes hands (a booking, an order, a receipt) is shown as a paper docket with its reference number in monospace.</li>
        <li><strong>Two densities.</strong> Customers get one comfortable column and big tap targets, with the main action at the bottom on a phone. Staff get the full width and an action beside each row.</li>
        <li><strong>Summary before detail.</strong> Lead with what needs attention (what's pending, what's ready), then the rest.</li>
        <li><strong>Real content only.</strong> Real dishes, prices in RM, and real statuses. No placeholder text, no invented figures.</li>
        <li><strong>One bold thing.</strong> The docket is the signature. Everything around it stays plain: no gradients, no extra shadows, no decoration.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="colour">
    <h2>Colour</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">Use the tokens (<code>var(--rr-pandan)</code>) or the Bootstrap classes, which already use them (<code>btn-primary</code>, <code>text-bg-warning</code>, <code>alert-danger</code>).</p>
    <div class="sg-swatches">
        <div class="sg-swatch"><span class="sg-chip" style="background:#f1f3f1"></span><strong>Marble</strong><span class="rr-ref">#F1F3F1 · --rr-marble</span><span>Page background, the tabletop.</span></div>
        <div class="sg-swatch"><span class="sg-chip" style="background:#ffffff"></span><strong>Enamel</strong><span class="rr-ref">#FFFFFF · --rr-enamel</span><span>Cards, dockets, the header.</span></div>
        <div class="sg-swatch"><span class="sg-chip" style="background:#1d1a17"></span><strong>Kopi-O</strong><span class="rr-ref">#1D1A17 · --rr-kopi</span><span>Text and headings.</span></div>
        <div class="sg-swatch"><span class="sg-chip" style="background:#0b6b4f"></span><strong>Pandan</strong><span class="rr-ref">#0B6B4F · --rr-pandan</span><span>Actions, links, chosen options, confirmed and ready.</span></div>
        <div class="sg-swatch"><span class="sg-chip" style="background:#e9b23c"></span><strong>Kaya</strong><span class="rr-ref">#E9B23C · --rr-kaya</span><span>Needs attention: pending, new. A fill behind dark text, never text on white.</span></div>
        <div class="sg-swatch"><span class="sg-chip" style="background:#a86b3c"></span><strong>Teh</strong><span class="rr-ref">#A86B3C · --rr-teh</span><span>Being worked on: preparing.</span></div>
        <div class="sg-swatch"><span class="sg-chip" style="background:#c2381c"></span><strong>Sambal</strong><span class="rr-ref">#C2381C · --rr-sambal</span><span>Cancel, errors, refusals.</span></div>
        <div class="sg-swatch"><span class="sg-chip" style="background:#d8dcd7"></span><strong>Line</strong><span class="rr-ref">#D8DCD7 · --rr-line</span><span>Borders and rules. Secondary text is <span class="rr-ref">#5D625C</span>.</span></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="type">
    <h2>Type</h2>
    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
            <div class="sg-demo">
                <span class="rr-label">Display · Zilla Slab · headings, table numbers, the wordmark</span>
                <p class="h1 mt-2">Book a table, then order from it.</p>
                <p class="h2">Manage reservations</p>
                <p class="h3 mb-0">Table 6</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5">
            <div class="sg-demo h-100">
                <span class="rr-label">Body · Plus Jakarta Sans · everything else</span>
                <p class="mt-2">Reserve a lunch or dinner seating ahead. Once you're sitting down, order from your phone.</p>
                <span class="rr-label">Monospace · references and money</span>
                <p class="mt-2 mb-0"><span class="rr-ref">ORD-001257</span> · <span class="rr-ref">RES-001840</span> · <span class="rr-money">RM 26.90</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted mt-3 mb-0">Headings use <code>h1</code>–<code>h3</code> (slab). Small uppercase labels use <code>rr-label</code>, only for real labels such as "Seating" or "Table". References use <code>rr-ref</code>; money uses <code>rr-money</code> so the digits line up.</p>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="words">
    <h2>Words</h2>
    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <ul class="sg-rules">
                <li>Buttons say what happens: <strong>Book table</strong>, <strong>Start preparing</strong>, <strong>Cancel booking</strong>. Never "Submit" or "OK".</li>
                <li>Sentence case everywhere: "Manage reservations", not "Manage Reservations".</li>
                <li>After an action, say what happened: "RES-001840 is now confirmed."</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <ul class="sg-rules">
                <li>Errors say what went wrong and what to do next: "That table is already booked for this seating. Choose another time or table."</li>
                <li>Formats: <span class="rr-money">RM 85.50</span> · Mon, 26 Oct 2026 · 7:30 PM · <span class="rr-ref">ORD-001257</span>. Use the formatter classes, never format inline.</li>
                <li>Name things the way people know them: "My orders", "Order queue", not "Order entities".</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="buttons">
    <h2>Buttons</h2>
    <div class="sg-demo d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Book table</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Back to my reservations</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger">Cancel booking</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger">Cancel this booking</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Confirm</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">Edit</button>
        <a href="#buttons">A plain link</a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted mt-3 mb-0">One <code>btn-primary</code> per view: the thing most people came to do. Everything else is <code>btn-outline-secondary</code>. Cancelling uses <code>btn-outline-danger</code>, and <code>btn-danger</code> only on the page that confirms it. Use <code>btn-sm</code> for actions on a row.</p>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="status">
    <h2>Status</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">A status pill is <code>&lt;span class="rr-status rr-status--good"&gt;Confirmed&lt;/span&gt;</code>. The modifier is what the status means, so each module maps its own statuses onto the same six.</p>
    <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table align-middle mb-0">
            <thead>
                <tr><th>Modifier</th><th>Means</th><th>Orders</th><th>Reservations</th><th>Payments (suggested)</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td><code>--attention</code></td><td>Waiting for someone</td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--attention">Pending</span></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--attention">Pending</span></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--attention">Waiting at counter</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><code>--progress</code></td><td>Being worked on</td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--progress">Preparing</span></td><td></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--progress">Paying online</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><code>--good</code></td><td>Done well, ready</td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--good">Ready</span></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--good">Confirmed</span></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--good">Paid</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><code>--done</code></td><td>Finished</td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--done">Served</span> <span class="rr-status rr-status--done">Completed</span></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--done">Completed</span></td><td></td></tr>
                <tr><td><code>--off</code></td><td>No longer happening</td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--off">Cancelled</span></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--off">Cancelled</span></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--off">Refunded</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td><code>--bad</code></td><td>Went wrong</td><td></td><td></td><td><span class="rr-status rr-status--bad">Failed</span></td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="forms">
    <h2>Forms</h2>
    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
            <div class="rr-panel">
                <div class="mb-4">
                    <label class="form-label" for="sg-date">Date</label>
                    <input class="form-control" id="sg-date" type="date" value="2026-10-26" style="max-width: 14rem" />
                </div>

                <fieldset class="mb-4">
                    <legend class="form-label fs-6">Seating</legend>
                    <div class="rr-tile-group">
                        <span class="rr-label mb-2">Lunch</span>
                        <div class="rr-tiles rr-tiles--wide">
                            <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="sg-slot" id="sg-slot-1200" />
                            <label class="rr-tile" for="sg-slot-1200">12:00 PM</label>
                            <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="sg-slot" id="sg-slot-1330" />
                            <label class="rr-tile" for="sg-slot-1330">1:30 PM</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rr-tile-group">
                        <span class="rr-label mb-2">Dinner</span>
                        <div class="rr-tiles rr-tiles--wide">
                            <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="sg-slot" id="sg-slot-1800" />
                            <label class="rr-tile" for="sg-slot-1800">6:00 PM</label>
                            <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="sg-slot" id="sg-slot-1930" checked />
                            <label class="rr-tile" for="sg-slot-1930">7:30 PM</label>
                            <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="sg-slot" id="sg-slot-2100" />
                            <label class="rr-tile" for="sg-slot-2100">9:00 PM</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <fieldset class="mb-4">
                    <legend class="form-label fs-6">Table</legend>
                    <div class="rr-tiles">
                        @for (var table = 1; table <= 10; table++)
                        {
                            <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="sg-table" id="sg-table-@table" checked="@(table == 3)" disabled="@(table == 5)" />
                            <label class="rr-tile" for="sg-table-@table">@table</label>
                        }
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-text">Table 5 shows the "taken" state.</div>
                </fieldset>

                <div class="mb-4">
                    <label class="form-label d-block" for="sg-party">Party size</label>
                    <div class="rr-stepper" data-sg-stepper>
                        <button type="button" class="rr-stepper__button" data-step="-1" aria-label="One person fewer">&minus;</button>
                        <input class="rr-stepper__input" id="sg-party" type="number" value="2" min="1" max="20" />
                        <button type="button" class="rr-stepper__button" data-step="1" aria-label="One person more">+</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="form-label" for="sg-request">Special request (optional)</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control is-invalid" id="sg-request" rows="2">A table by the window, a high chair, and a birthday cake at 8 pm with candles, please ...</textarea>
                    <div class="invalid-feedback">Keep the special request to 500 characters or fewer.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5">
            <ul class="sg-rules">
                <li><strong>Choice tiles</strong> (<code>rr-tiles</code> + <code>rr-tile</code>) replace dropdowns when there are a few options people compare: seatings, tables, payment methods. Each tile is a real radio button (<code>btn-check</code>), so the form sends it like any other field.</li>
                <li><strong>Steppers</strong> (<code>rr-stepper</code>) are for small counts: party size, quantities. The number stays a real input people can type into.</li>
                <li>Every field has a visible label. Optional fields say "(optional)"; required ones say nothing.</li>
                <li>Validation messages sit under the field, in sambal, and say how to fix it.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="dockets">
    <h2>Dockets</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">The signature. A docket is <code>rr-docket</code>: a head (title, reference, status), lines (<code>rr-docket__line</code> with quantity, item, amount), a dashed tear line before the total, then the next step.</p>
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
            <span class="rr-label mb-3">In the kitchen</span>
            <article class="rr-docket">
                <div class="rr-docket__head">
                    <div>
                        <span class="rr-docket__title">Table 4</span>
                        <span class="rr-ref">ORD-001256 · 9:08 PM</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="rr-status rr-status--attention">Pending</span>
                </div>
                <ol class="rr-docket__lines">
                    <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">2 ×</span> <span>Nasi Lemak</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount">25.80</span></li>
                    <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">3 ×</span> <span>Teh Tarik</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount">11.40</span></li>
                </ol>
                <div class="rr-docket__total"><span>Total</span><span class="rr-money">RM 37.20</span></div>
                <div class="rr-docket__meta"><span class="rr-status rr-status--off">Not paid</span><span>Placed 12 min ago</span></div>
                <div class="rr-docket__actions">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Start preparing</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger">Cancel</button>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
            <span class="rr-label mb-3">For the customer</span>
            <article class="rr-docket">
                <div class="rr-docket__head">
                    <div>
                        <span class="rr-docket__title">Table 6</span>
                        <span class="rr-ref">ORD-001257 · 25 Oct, 9:08 PM</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="rr-status rr-status--progress">Preparing</span>
                </div>
                <ol class="rr-steps mb-4" aria-label="Order progress">
                    <li class="is-done">Pending</li>
                    <li class="is-current" aria-current="step">Preparing</li>
                    <li>Ready</li>
                    <li>Served</li>
                </ol>
                <ol class="rr-docket__lines">
                    <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">1 ×</span> <span>Char Kway Teow</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount">13.90</span></li>
                    <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">2 ×</span> <span>Cendol</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount">13.00</span></li>
                </ol>
                <div class="rr-docket__total"><span>Total</span><span class="rr-money">RM 26.90</span></div>
                <div class="rr-docket__actions">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Go to payment</button>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xl-4">
            <ul class="sg-rules">
                <li>Use a docket for a record a person hands over or receives: an order, a booking, a payment receipt.</li>
                <li>Not for navigation or settings. Those are plain cards (<code>rr-feature</code>, <code>rr-panel</code>).</li>
                <li>The steps line (<code>rr-steps</code>) shows where something is in a fixed journey. It doesn't update by itself.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="board">
    <h2>Order rail</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">For staff boards: <code>rr-board</code> holds columns (<code>rr-board__column</code>), each with a title and count, a steel rail, and dockets hanging from it. Four columns on a wide screen, two on a tablet, one on a phone.</p>
    <div class="rr-board">
        <section class="rr-board__column" aria-label="Pending">
            <h3 class="rr-board__title">Pending <span class="rr-board__count">1</span></h3>
            <div class="rr-board__rail"></div>
            <div class="rr-board__dockets">
                <article class="rr-docket">
                    <div class="rr-docket__head"><div><span class="rr-docket__title">Table 4</span><span class="rr-ref">ORD-001256 · 9:08 PM</span></div></div>
                    <ol class="rr-docket__lines">
                        <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">2 ×</span> <span>Nasi Lemak</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount"></span></li>
                        <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">3 ×</span> <span>Teh Tarik</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount"></span></li>
                    </ol>
                    <div class="rr-docket__actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Start preparing</button></div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="rr-board__column" aria-label="Preparing">
            <h3 class="rr-board__title">Preparing <span class="rr-board__count">1</span></h3>
            <div class="rr-board__rail"></div>
            <div class="rr-board__dockets">
                <article class="rr-docket">
                    <div class="rr-docket__head"><div><span class="rr-docket__title">Table 6</span><span class="rr-ref">ORD-001257 · 9:08 PM</span></div></div>
                    <ol class="rr-docket__lines">
                        <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">1 ×</span> <span>Char Kway Teow</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount"></span></li>
                        <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">2 ×</span> <span>Cendol</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount"></span></li>
                    </ol>
                    <div class="rr-docket__actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Mark ready</button></div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="rr-board__column" aria-label="Ready">
            <h3 class="rr-board__title">Ready <span class="rr-board__count">1</span></h3>
            <div class="rr-board__rail"></div>
            <div class="rr-board__dockets">
                <article class="rr-docket">
                    <div class="rr-docket__head"><div><span class="rr-docket__title">Table 2</span><span class="rr-ref">ORD-001258 · 9:08 PM</span></div></div>
                    <ol class="rr-docket__lines">
                        <li class="rr-docket__line"><span class="rr-docket__qty">3 ×</span> <span>Roti Canai (2 pieces)</span> <span class="rr-docket__amount"></span></li>
                    </ol>
                    <div class="rr-docket__actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Mark served</button></div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="rr-board__column" aria-label="Served">
            <h3 class="rr-board__title">Served <span class="rr-board__count">0</span></h3>
            <div class="rr-board__rail"></div>
            <p class="rr-board__empty">Nothing served yet.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="bookings">
    <h2>Bookings</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">A booking in a list is a slip (<code>rr-slip</code>) with a date block (<code>rr-dateblock</code>), so people see the day before anything else.</p>
    <div class="rr-narrow d-grid gap-3">
        <div class="rr-slip">
            <div class="rr-dateblock" aria-hidden="true"><span class="rr-dateblock__day">Mon</span><span class="rr-dateblock__date">26</span><span class="rr-dateblock__month">Oct</span></div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between gap-3">
                <div>
                    <div class="rr-slip__title">7:30 PM · Table 3 · 2 people</div>
                    <span class="rr-ref">RES-001840</span>
                    <p class="small text-muted mb-0 mt-1">Window seat please, it is our anniversary</p>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-sm-end gap-2">
                    <span class="rr-status rr-status--attention">Pending</span>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" href="#bookings">Change</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" href="#bookings">Cancel</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rr-slip">
            <div class="rr-dateblock" aria-hidden="true"><span class="rr-dateblock__day">Tue</span><span class="rr-dateblock__date">27</span><span class="rr-dateblock__month">Oct</span></div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between gap-3">
                <div>
                    <div class="rr-slip__title">12:00 PM · Table 5 · 4 people</div>
                    <span class="rr-ref">RES-001841</span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-sm-end gap-2">
                    <span class="rr-status rr-status--good">Confirmed</span>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" href="#bookings">Change</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" href="#bookings">Cancel</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sg-section" id="pieces">
    <h2>Page pieces</h2>

    <h3 class="h4 mt-4">Page header</h3>
    <div class="sg-demo">
        <div class="rr-page-header mb-0">
            <div>
                <div class="h1 mb-0">My reservations</div>
                <p class="rr-lede">Your upcoming bookings. Change or cancel them up to the seating.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rr-page-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Book a table</button></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted mt-2">Every page starts with <code>rr-page-header</code>: the title, one line of context if it helps, and the page's main action on the right.</p>

    <h3 class="h4 mt-4">Filters</h3>
    <div class="sg-demo">
        <nav class="nav nav-pills" aria-label="Status">
            <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="#pieces">All</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#pieces">Pending</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#pieces">Confirmed</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#pieces">Cancelled</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#pieces">Completed</a>
        </nav>
    </div>
    <p class="text-muted mt-2">Filters are <code>nav-pills</code> links, so the choice is in the address and one tap applies it. No "Show" button.</p>

    <h3 class="h4 mt-4">Messages</h3>
    <div class="d-grid gap-2">
        <div class="alert alert-success mb-0" role="status">Your reservation has been updated.</div>
